          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146314,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does setting the width of a child element to <code>100%</code> do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It makes the element fill the entire width of the parent element</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It makes the element extend to its full size</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It makes the element fill the entire width of the parent element.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146315,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we set this health bar label's width to <code>50%</code>?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health Bar\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"50%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": antiquewhite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It becomes half of the <code>body</code> element's size</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It becomes half the size of its content</item></selection><webview visible-if=\"correct\"><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html> <head><style>p { width: 50%; background-color: antiquewhite; }</style></head> <body> <p>Health Bar</p> </body> </html>]]></webview><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It becomes half of the <code>body</code> element's size.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146316,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What element does a percentage refer to when we nest an element inside another element, like a <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Percentages refer to the new parent element</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Percentages always refer to the <code>body</code> element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Percentages refer to the new parent element.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146317,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we set the <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> element around a score label to <code>200px</code> and the label width to <code>50%</code>?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"div\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"200px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"50%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": antiquewhite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" cla